Output: k:INTEGER count_star():BIGINT
Project k, "count_star()"
  Sort k ASC NULLS LAST
    GroupAggregate keys=["((ct_id % 2) + min(zn_id))"] COUNT(*)
      Compute ((ct_id % 2) + min(zn_id))
        Join ONE-ROW build=right keys=[]
          Scan table=cities source=parquet(files=1, rows=6) columns=[ct_id]
          Aggregate MIN(zn_id)
            Scan table=zones source=parquet(files=1, rows=40) columns=[zn_id]
